5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I am tired of ribbon-cutting ceremonies for projects that crumble by winter.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The ground here is tricky. I need to know what the soil actually allows.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,Pretty plans are cheap. I care about the bills that arrive three years later.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Who is actually going to mow this? The rota is shrinking every year.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,This park is used daily. I need to see how people actually move through it.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, exactly. The initial budget is a lie. I want the real cost.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, agreed. But if the ground shifts, the cost is irrelevant.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, true. But if we can't afford the upkeep, it's a liability.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, the usage patterns will tell us if the plan is viable.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, yes. The data on crossings is key to understanding the flow.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will look at the condition of works from the earlier programme.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will check the regional firms tendering for earth-moving.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
