35,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The earlier works are a mess. The apron has been patched three times.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Only two firms can handle the earth. Both flagged clay and slippage risk.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Mio,,Planted ground costs triple to maintain. The habitat fund won't cover surfacing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"We have seven staff left. Volunteer groups cover weekends, but it's tight.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,People cross on hard ground. Drainage callouts have doubled since the cap.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, the fund terms are restrictive. It only pays for planting and water.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, the clay risk means we can't do deep excavation easily.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, that aligns. If we can't afford the upkeep, we shouldn't plant.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, the volunteer groups are helpful, but they can't do heavy maintenance.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, the drainage issue is serious. We need a plan that manages water.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The eastern avenue planting failed. Half the trees died. Aftercare was missing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"The depot notes say the south can be hoarded, but the centre cannot.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Mio,,The ledger shows the gap in costs is widening. Hard surfaces are cheaper.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"The volunteer groups are good for habitat, but not for courts or plazas.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,"The heat readings are high. We need shade, but not at the cost of drainage.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I am leaning towards something that doesn't rely on fragile planting.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Misaki,,The earth-moving constraints rule out major reshaping.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Mio,,"The financials favor hard surfaces, but we need to consider the fund.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Asuka,,The staffing levels suggest we need low-maintenance options.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,"The usage data suggests we need open, firm ground for crossings.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
